          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NW      CHOLESBURY-CUM-ST LEONARDS      JENKINS LANE                                               (north side)                                               St Leonards 2/80    \t\t\t\t      White Lion\t                                               Public House - -                                             II Public House.  C17 altered.  Timber framed rear wall with brick nogging. Colourwashed roughcast front elevation, old tiled roof; two stacks on ridge and two gabled eaves dormers, with 2-light casements.  One storey and attic. Half glazed door and two small modern bow windows.  Southern part is half of an adjoining cottage, partly demolished, leaving a modern south gable wall.  Interior: ceiling beams, inglenook. Listing NGR: SP9184106989"
    }
  ],
